Third-party content
-------------------

This license covers the code and the original writing in this repository:
the Python scripts, the shell scripts, the `d*.md` guides, and the
hand-written wiki pages under `Context-Wiki-Infra/Wiki/Concepts/` and
`Context-Wiki-Infra/Wiki/Entities/`.

It does NOT cover third-party documentation.

`Context-Wiki-Infra/Raw/` holds verbatim captures of documentation published
by AWS, Cloudflare, Google, Microsoft, Mozilla (MDN), OWASP, the PostgreSQL
and SQLite projects, and others. Those remain under their own licences and
are deliberately excluded from version control (see `.gitignore`); run
`python raw_download.py` to fetch your own copies. Each capture records its
source URL and retrieval date in a provenance header, and every source is
listed in `Context-Wiki-Infra/Raw/sources.md`.

The pages under `Context-Wiki-Infra/Wiki/Summaries/` quote short lead
passages and heading outlines from those sources for identification and
navigation, with attribution and a link to the original in every case.
